        "cooked": "<p>I've just started up the game. I have a decent sized screen, and I'm not too far away, but for some reason, I'm having trouble reading the text. I don't have this issue with my other Switch Games. Has anyone else experienced this? Either the text for the Switch version needs to be bigger or in a font that's easier to read.</p>",
